\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {5.3}{\ignorespaces Stress--strain loop of \code {TrussPlastic2D} ($E=200$ GPa, $\sigma _y=250$ MPa, $H=5$ GPa): the element against the closed-form return map. Produced by \texttt {scripts/ch05\_assets.py}.\relax }}{39}{figure.caption.71}%
