\contentsline {figure}{\numberline {13.8}{\ignorespaces Left: error of the reduced force against the number of selected elements. Right: the elements selected by plain and by contact-aware ECSW; the shaded band holds the elements that touch the contact block.\relax }}{132}{figure.caption.239}%
